  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://upsssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Service Selection Commission (UPSSSC)</a></span> has released the answer key for the Female Health Worker (ANM) Post. This recruitment was released for 5272 posts. The applications for UPSSSC Female Health Worker (ANM) Recruitment 2024 were accepted from October 28, 2024, to November 27, 2024. <span data-teams=\"true\">The written examination is scheduled to be conducted on January 11, 2026. Candidates who appeared for this examination can download their UPSSSC Female Health Worker (ANM) Answer Key 2026 from the link provided below.</span></span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Service Selection Commission (UPSSSC) </span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UPSSSC Female Health Worker Answer Key 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UPSSSC Advt No. : 11-Exam/2024</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>14 October 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>28 October 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <b>27 November 2024</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date of Fee Payment :<strong> 27 November 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Last Date :&nbsp;<strong>04 December 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>11 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>01 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>07 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>16 April 2026 Available</strong></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General / OBC / EWS : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>25/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC / ST : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>25/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PH (Dviyang) : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>25/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC Female Health Worker (ANM) Notification 2024 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>As on 01 July 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>21 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per UPSSSC Female Health Worker (ANM) Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC Female Health Worker (ANM) 2024 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 5272 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 41.5188%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Category</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9677%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Posts</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 41.5188%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Female Health Worker (ANM)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9677%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">2399</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9677%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">489</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9677%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">1559</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9677%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">435</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.5134%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.9677%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">390</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UPSSSC Female Health Worker (ANM) Recruitment 2024 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates Must Have ANM Degree / Diploma from Any Recognized University in India &amp; 2023 PET Score Card Can Apply For This Post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download UPSSSC Female Health Worker Answer Key 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Check the Important Links section</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then click on the Download answer key link</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After clicking on the link, candidates will be redirected to the dashboard page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page candidates have to fill up the following fields with proper details:</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Candidate’s Registration Number</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Date of Birth</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Gender</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Verification Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates will be required to submit the details in order to download the answer key.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">The candidate can also download it from the official Website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC Female Health Worker (ANM) Recruitment 2024 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #