: #000000;\"><strong>Important Question</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. Has the UPSSSC Female Health Worker Answer Key 2026 been released?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>Yes, the UPSSSC Female Health Worker Answer Key 2026 has been released.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. When was the UPSSSC Female Health Worker Answer Key 2026 officially announced?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The UPSSSC Female Health Worker Answer Key has issued on 16 April&nbsp; 2026 by UPSSSC.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. When will the UPSSSC Female Health Worker (ANM) exam be held?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong> The UPSSSC Female Health Worker (ANM) written examination will be conducted on <strong data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"226\">11th January 2026</strong>.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. Where can I check the UPSSSC Female Health Worker (ANM) Answer Key 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>You can check it on the official UPSSSC website:&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"603\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" style=\"color: #000000;\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"601\">upsssc.gov.in</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What should I search on the website to find the UPSSSC Female Health Worker Answer Key 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong> Look for&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"797\">“Answer Key – Female Health Worker (ANM) Recruitment 2024”</strong>&nbsp;in the notifications list.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. &nbsp;How can I download the UPSSSC Female Health Worker (ANM) Answer Key?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong> Visit upsssc.gov.in → Notice Board → Download Answer Key.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. Will UPSSSC Female Health Worker (ANM) Answer Key also be available on the same website?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong> Yes, UPSSSC Female Health Worker (ANM) Answer Key will be available only on <strong data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1629\">upsssc.gov.in</strong>&nbsp;before the exam.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is UPSSSC Official Website?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of UPSSSC is https://upsssc.gov.in/</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
